EWP 

* Runs as an App Service on it’s on Azure subscriptions (dev+prod);
* Uses storage account, cosmosdb, virtual network and keyvault;
* UI programmed with C# (including Blazor) with a bit of JS;
* API programmed in C#
* 2 web jobs (deprecated, replaced with Azure Functions): one for emails, one for stats

